== External training and validation data

No labelled data from the target match is used for training. The PP-TCN is trained on 19 licensed external matches: 5 from IDSSE @bassek2025 (CC BY 4.0, possession labels from the provider) and 14 from SkillCorner Open Data @skillcorner (MIT, provider phases-of-play used as proxy labels). Metrica sample data @metricasample (event-derived proxy labels) is used only for development selection (Games 1–2, clean and degraded) and evaluation (Game 3). It is not used to train the selected networks. Our source audit found no explicit license for it.

= Method <sec:method>

@fig:pipeline gives an overview. The method runs offline at 5 fps, and its predictions are expanded back to the 25-fps tactical timeline.

